# Configuration 14 -- the same shared ore field, but every line keeps a bay.
#
#                        Shared ore network
#                               |
#          +--------------------+--------------------+
#          v                    v                    v
#      Smelter x4           Smelter x4           Smelter x4
#          |                    |                    |
#      PlateBay#0           PlateBay#1           PlateBay#15    <- private
#
# Config 13 collapses because there is nothing private in it: two lines have no
# state that could tell them apart. Here each line has a buffer of its own, and
# that buffer is exactly the state that makes lines different. So the
# deployment cannot become a population, and the compiler says so by writing
# the sixteen lines out one by one instead -- an exact answer at a worse price,
# which is better than a refusal.
#
# The interesting question is how *much* they differ. Round-robin at OreNet is
# max-min fair, so all sixteen lines are served identically except for the
# remainder of the last incomplete lap, and that remainder rotates. The harness
# measures how many genuinely distinct line states the plant visits over time.
# If that number stays small, the compression really can move up a level and a
# deployment becomes a population of *line* states rather than machine states.
# That is the v4 question, asked here with numbers rather than hope.
#
#   field       1 x 200 / 20   = 10.00 ore/tick shared between everybody
#   smelters   16 x 4 x 20/40  = 32.00 ore/tick of appetite
#   depots     16 x 100 / 600  =  2.67 plate/tick of appetite
#
# so the ore field is fought over, and the private bays fill at slightly
# different rates, which is the divergence being measured.

item IronOre
item IronPlate

blueprint PrivateLine {
    shared storage OreNet   { capacity 100000  policy round_robin }
    shared source  Field x1 { produces 200 IronOre every 20 ticks }

    process Smelter x4      { consumes 20 IronOre takes 40 ticks produces 20 IronPlate }
    storage PlateBay        { capacity 40000   policy round_robin }
    sink    Depot x1        { consumes 100 IronPlate every 600 ticks }

    wire Field -> OreNet -> Smelter -> PlateBay -> Depot
}

deploy 16 x PrivateLine
